  "question": {
    "text": "Total number of tripeptides possible by mixing of valine and proline is ________ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A peptide is a short chain of amino acids (typically 2 to 50) linked by chemical bonds (called peptide bonds).&nbsp;</p><p>Number of possible tripeptide : Val &amp; Pro is 2<sup>3</sup></p><p>Possible tripeptides are:<br />(1) val &ndash; val &ndash; val<br />(2)pro &ndash; pro &ndash; pro<br />(3)val &ndash; pro &ndash; pro<br />(4)pro &ndash; val &ndash; pro<br />(5)val &ndash; val &ndash; pro<br />(6)val &ndash; pro &ndash; val<br />(7)pro &ndash; pro &ndash; val<br />(8)pro &ndash; val &ndash; val</p>",
    "image": null
